<section class="about-hero-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="about-content" data-aos="fade-up" style="max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center;">
      <h1 class="h1" style="color: var(--color-gold); margin-bottom: 40px;">THE SACRED KAPILA LEGACY</h1>
      <p class="p-large" style="line-height: 1.8; opacity: 0.9; margin-bottom: 40px;">
        We don’t manufacture Ghee. We preserve an ancient Vedic lineage. In a world of factory farming and industrial shortcuts, we chose the forest. Our ghee comes exclusively from the indigenous Kapila Red Cow, a breed revered in Ayurveda for its medicinal A2 milk.
      </p>
      
      <div style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); padding: 60px; border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 60px;">
        <h2 class="h3" style="color: var(--color-gold-light); margin-bottom: 20px;">The Lost Art of Vedic Nutrition</h2>
        <p class="p-large" style="opacity: 0.8;">
          Founded by Pavan Kumar, Worldsno1bestghee was born from a simple realization: modern machinery destroys nutrients. Following the 3,000-year-old Charaka Samhita texts, we’ve brought back the slow, wood-fired Bilona method to create a medicinal elixir, not just 'butter oil.'
        </p>
      </div>

      <div style="text-align: left; margin-top: 80px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 60px; align-items: center;">
        <div>
          <h3 class="h3" style="color: var(--color-gold); margin-bottom: 20px;">The Kapila Source</h3>
          <p style="margin-bottom: 20px; opacity: 0.8;">The Kapila Red Cow is one of India's rarest indigenous breeds. Their milk is naturally rich in A2 protein and contains gold minerals (Swarna Kshara) uniquely processed by the cow's surya ketu nadi (sun vein).</p>
          <p style="opacity: 0.8;">Our cows are never tied. they graze freely in the deep forests of the Annamayya hills, feeding on 40+ varieties of wild herbs like Ashwagandha and Amruthaballi.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);">
          {% if section.settings.image != blank %}
            <img src="{{ section.settings.image | image_url: width: 1000 }}" alt="{{ section.settings.image.alt | default: 'Kapila Red Cow' }}">
          {% else %}
            <img src="https://worldsno1bestghee.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Gemini_Generated_Image_dpn1vrdpn1vrdpn1-2-scaled.png" alt="Kapila Red Cow">
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "About Hero",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "image",
      "label": "Featured Image"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
